              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What is Lore?"
              }
            ],
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "body",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Lore is a Toronto-based independent, community-driven magazine. Each issue is built around a central theme, combining photography and original writing that explores culture, identity, and belonging. Lore recently won "
              },
              {
                "type": "span",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Magazine of the Year "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and "
              },
              {
                "type": "span",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Best Magazine Art, Literary, and Culture"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " at the "
              },
              {
                "type": "link",
                "href": "https://magazine-awards.com/en/2026winners/",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "2026 National Magazine Awards"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ". "
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "images/lore-2.png",
        "alt": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "richText",
        "role": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Currently, we have 4 issues that have been created over the past 2 years. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "images/lore-3.png",
        "alt": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "richText",
        "role": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We also have our magazine in multiple shops globally and want to keep expanding around the world. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "images/lore-4.png",
        "alt": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "richText",
        "role": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We organize photoshoots that highlight diverse models and local photographers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "images/lore-5.png",
        "alt": ""
      },
